#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:9
msgid "Assembly input and rejected selections"
msgstr "装配输入与拒绝规则"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:11
msgid ""
"The authored configuration authority is one schema-2 TOML assembly. SoC and "
"Board facts remain maintained JSON; `resolved.json` is output, not an "
"authored alternative. CMake owns software dependencies. Failed TOML "
"resolution never falls back to Kconfig, cache variables, schema-1 JSON or "
"old generated headers. Legacy JSON assemblies are rejected as inputs, not "
"retained as an alternate authoring interface."
msgstr ""
"人工编写的配置权威是一份 schema-2 TOML assembly。SoC 和 Board facts 仍为维护的 "
"JSON；`resolved.json` 是输出，不是另一种人工编写入口。CMake 拥有软件依赖。TOML 解析失败不会回退到 "
"Kconfig、cache 变量、schema-1 JSON 或旧生成头文件。旧 JSON 装配作为输入会被拒绝，不保留为另一种编写接口。"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:17
msgid ""
"The parser creates immutable `AuthoredAssembly` intent. Production consumers"
" use `resolve_ir()` and named immutable `ConfigurationIR` decisions; only "
"audit and artifact-boundary consumers request `to_dict()`. Typed source "
"epoch 2 and the schema-1 JSON output projection are separate contracts. The "
"[source compatibility policy](../../design/source-compatibility.md) owns "
"their version declarations; neither introduces firmware metadata or runtime "
"dispatch."
msgstr ""
"解析器创建不可变 `AuthoredAssembly` 意图。生产消费者使用 `resolve_ir()` 与具名、不可变的 "
"`ConfigurationIR` 决策；只有审计和产物边界消费者调用 `to_dict()`。Typed source epoch 2 与 "
"schema-1 JSON 输出投影是不同合同，其版本声明由[源码兼容策略](../../design/source-"
"compatibility.md)维护；两者均不引入固件元数据或运行时分发。"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:24
msgid ""
"Before running the resolver, prepare the [fixed source and recursive "
"dependencies](../../guides/source-checkout.md)."
msgstr "运行解析器前，先准备[固定源码与递归依赖](../../guides/source-checkout.md)。"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:27
msgid "Complete maintained input"
msgstr "完整维护输入"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:29
msgid "Complete F407ZG UART assembly, parsed by the production resolver."
msgstr "完整 F407ZG UART 装配，由生产 resolver 解析。"

