msgstr "可选的 schema-1 物理 Flash 擦除区 JSON 路径，相对装配定位；恰好一个 image 区"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:29
msgid "`[factory]`"
msgstr "`[factory]`"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:29
msgid "Optional capability metadata; only `capabilities` is accepted"
msgstr "可选能力元数据；仅接受 `capabilities`"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:29
