msgid "Stable authored name, reviewed binding, mode and bounded options"
msgstr "稳定人工编写的名称、复核绑定、模式与有界选项"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:29
msgid "SPI/I2C device table"
msgstr "SPI/I2C 器件表"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:29
msgid "Separate endpoint identity tied to an existing controller"
msgstr "关联已有控制器的独立端点身份"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:29
msgid "`[abi]`"
msgstr "`[abi]`"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:29
msgid ""
"Assert reviewed CPU architecture/FPU/float ABI; cannot invent chip features"
msgstr "断言复核 CPU architecture/FPU/float ABI；不能虚构芯片特性"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:49
msgid ""
"Resource checks cover actual pin/AF, controller, IRQ ceiling, shared "
"timer/timebase, physical DMA controller/stream, clock, exact memory domain, "
"mode and endpoint identity. A syntactically valid selector can still reject "
"because that provider does not implement the route. The resolver never "
"silently changes pins, modes or clock."
msgstr ""
"资源检查覆盖实际引脚／AF、控制器、IRQ 系统调用优先级阈值、共享定时器／时间基准、物理 DMA "
"控制器／流、时钟、准确内存域、模式及端点身份。即使选择项语法合法，仍可能因提供者未实现该路由而被拒绝。解析器绝不静默改变引脚、模式或时钟。"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:54
msgid ""
"See the [configuration and ownership guide](../../guides/developer-"
"workflow.md) for Board-first queries, validated profiles, human summaries "
"and effective diffs. `explain` defaults to human-readable output; automation"
" must select `--json`."
msgstr ""
"[配置与所有权指南](../../guides/developer-workflow.md)说明从 Board 查询、经验证的 "
"profile、人读摘要及有效差异。`explain` 默认输出人读内容；自动化必须选择 `--json`。"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:58
msgid ""
"Every generated bundle contains `nexus_factory_strong.h`. Application code "
"can include it and use nominal references such as `NX_UART_REF_UART0` with "
"`nx_factory_uart_ref`; no `[factory]` selection enables that header. "
"`factory.strong` is not a supported field and rejects as unknown. The "
"optional `capabilities = true` selection emits immutable mode metadata "
"separately from the interface faces. Factory getters return existing static "
"objects and do not start hardware."
msgstr ""
"每个生成 bundle 都包含 `nexus_factory_strong.h`。应用代码可以包含该头文件，并将 `NX_UART_REF_UART0`"
" 这类具有独立类型的引用传给 `nx_factory_uart_ref`；无需通过 `[factory]` "
"选择启用该头文件。`factory.strong` 不是受支持字段，会因未知字段而被拒绝。可选的 `capabilities = true` "
"选择会生成不可变的模式元数据，与接口面分开。factory getter 返回既有静态对象，不启动硬件。"

msgid "ADC raw resolution and scan timing"
msgstr "ADC 原始分辨率与扫描时序"

msgid ""
"For the maintained F407 ADC1 modes, `resolution_bits` selects 6, 8, 10 or 12"
" bits. Omitting it produces an explicit 12-bit decision in the immutable IR "
"and resolved audit output. Booleans, strings and other integer values "
"reject. A provider must declare support for the chosen resolution; the "
"configuration field alone does not grant another device that capability."
msgstr ""
"已维护的 F407 ADC1 模式通过 `resolution_bits` 选择 6、8、10 或 12 位。省略时，不可变 IR "
"与解析后的审计输出明确记录为 12 位。布尔值、字符串及其他整数均拒绝。provider 必须声明支持所选分辨率，配置字段本身不会授予其他器件相应能力。"

msgid ""
"The following fragment belongs in an assembly whose Board explicitly "
"authorizes the `analog` ADC binding. It is not a complete assembly or a PCB "
"wiring claim."
msgstr "以下片段应放入 Board 明确授权了 `analog` ADC 绑定的装配中；它不是完整装配，也不声明 PCB 接线。"

msgid ""
"Polling, finite trigger DMA and continuous trigger DMA share the selected "
"raw format. According to RM0090 Rev22 §13.7, one rank costs its selected "
"acquisition cycles plus 12, 10, 8 or 6 conversion cycles. Rate admission and"
" continuous sequence metadata use the complete scan cost. A timer divider "
"must also be exact; lowering the resolution never silently changes the "
"requested trigger rate."
msgstr ""
"poll、有限触发 DMA 和连续触发 DMA 共用所选原始格式。依据 RM0090 Rev22 §13.7，每 rank 的耗时为所选采样周期加 "
"12、10、8 或 6 个转换周期。速率准入和连续序列元数据使用完整扫描成本。定时器分频也必须精确，降低分辨率不会静默修改请求的触发速率。"

msgid ""
"DMA still transfers halfwords, and each sample remains a right-aligned "
"native `uint16_t` raw count. Block capacities and lengths remain byte counts"
" and must contain whole scans. No packed byte format or extra buffer is "
"introduced for 6- or 8-bit conversions. These software facts do not "
"establish analog accuracy, effective resolution, sample aperture timestamps "
"or physical throughput."
msgstr ""
"DMA 仍传输 halfword，每个样本仍是右对齐的本机 `uint16_t` 原始计数。块容量与长度仍以字节计，必须包含整数个完整 scan。6 "
"位或 8 位转换不引入压缩字节格式或额外缓冲区。这些软件事实不建立模拟精度、有效分辨率、采样孔径时间戳或实际吞吐资格。"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:66
msgid "Physical Flash and the selected image"
msgstr "物理 Flash 与所选镜像"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:68
msgid ""
"`flash` in the resolved output describes the complete physical device, "
"including its exact erase and programming geometry. `layout` selects the "
"physical erase owner that contains the executable image. Without an authored"
" `layout`, that owner is the complete physical Flash. Products still own "
"writable regions and recovery; this selection grants no Flash access control"
" or protection."
msgstr ""
"解析输出中的 `flash` 描述完整物理器件，包括精确的擦除与编程几何。`layout` 选择包含可执行镜像的物理擦除区。未编写 `layout` "
"时，该区域为完整物理 Flash。可写区域和恢复仍由产品负责；此选择不提供 Flash 访问控制或写保护。"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:74
msgid ""
"A `layout` JSON file has `schema_version = 1` and `regions`. Each region has"
" an `id`, integer `origin`, positive `size` and `kind` (`image` or `data`). "
"Exactly one region is an image. IDs must be unique; all regions must be "
"nonoverlapping, within physical Flash, and start/end on its exact erase "
"boundaries. This is an auxiliary layout input; schema-1 JSON assemblies "
"remain rejected."
msgstr ""
"`layout` JSON 文件包含 `schema_version = 1` 和 `regions`。各 region 具有 `id`、整数 "
"`origin`、正数 `size` 和 `kind`（`image` 或 `data`）。只能有一个 image region。ID 必须唯一；全部 "
"region 必须互不重叠、位于物理 Flash 内，并从其精确擦除边界开始、结束。这是辅助 layout 输入；schema-1 JSON "
"装配仍然拒绝。"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:80
msgid "Executable prefix and suffix"
msgstr "执行区的前缀与尾部保留量"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:82
msgid ""
"The optional `[memory]` fields reserve bytes inside the selected physical "
"owner. Both fields are unsigned 32-bit byte counts with a default of zero. "
"Booleans, floats, negative values and values above `4294967295` reject. "
"Zero-valued fields are omitted from the resolved projection. They preserve "
"the existing default layout, linked addresses and budgets; source changes "
"still change source and configuration identities."
msgstr ""
"可选的 `[memory]` 字段在选定物理擦除区内部保留字节。两个字段均为无符号 32 位字节数，默认值为零。布尔值、浮点数、负数以及大于 "
"`4294967295` 的值均拒绝。零值字段不写入解析投影。零值保留现有默认布局、链接地址和预算；源码变更仍会改变源码与配置身份。"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:29
msgid "Field"
msgstr "字段"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:29
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:29
msgid "`image_prefix_bytes`"
msgstr "`image_prefix_bytes`"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:29
msgid "Reserved bytes before the executable vector table"
msgstr "可执行向量表之前保留的字节数"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:29
msgid "`image_suffix_bytes`"
msgstr "`image_suffix_bytes`"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:29
msgid "Reserved bytes after the executable load window"
msgstr "执行加载窗口之后保留的字节数"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:94
msgid ""
"`ConfigurationIR` derives the executable origin and size from its immutable "
"`FlashRegionIR` owner and `MemoryBudgetIR` reservations. `PhysicalPartIR` "
"remains the sole physical geometry authority; the JSON `layout` projection "
"retains that geometry for audit. No independent executable address or CMake "
"address override is authored."
msgstr ""
"`ConfigurationIR` 根据不可变的 `FlashRegionIR` 物理擦除区和 `MemoryBudgetIR` "
"保留量派生执行起点与大小。`PhysicalPartIR` 仍是物理几何的唯一权威；JSON `layout` "
"投影保留该几何用于审计。用户不另行编写执行地址，也不通过 CMake 覆盖地址。"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:107
msgid ""
"The physical owner remains erase-aligned and nonoverlapping. Its executable "
"window need not start on an erase boundary. The prefix plus suffix must be "
"less than the owner size and leave a complete reset vector. The derived "
"window must stay inside that owner without address overflow. An explicit "
"`flash_load_limit_bytes` cannot exceed the executable size; the default "
"Flash budget uses that size. Reserved prefix/suffix bytes do not count as "
"actual ELF LOAD bytes and do not change the physical Flash API."
msgstr ""
"物理擦除区仍须按擦除边界对齐，且各区不得重叠。其内部执行窗口无需从擦除边界开始。前缀与尾部之和必须小于物理区大小，并留出完整复位向量。派生窗口必须位于该物理区内，地址不得溢出。显式"
" `flash_load_limit_bytes` 不得超过执行区大小；默认 Flash 预算采用执行区大小。前缀与尾部的保留字节不计为实际 ELF "
"LOAD 字节，也不改变物理 Flash API。"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:115
msgid ""
"The reviewed offset and nonzero-reservation profiles are STM32F407VET6 and "
"STM32F407ZGT6. They require complete physical erase geometry and a 512-byte-"
"aligned executable vector base, including when the physical owner starts at "
"the reset address. Other SoCs and external provider packages gain no "
"prefix/suffix support from these fields. The maintained profile owns that "
"exact alignment and its actual vendor vector symbol; authored or artifact "
"metadata cannot grant another startup that capability."
msgstr ""
"经审阅的偏移与非零预留 profile 为 STM32F407VET6 和 STM32F407ZGT6。它们要求完整物理擦除几何及 512 "
"字节对齐的可执行向量基址，即使物理所有者从复位地址开始也不例外。其他 SoC 与外部 provider 包不会因这些字段获得前缀/后缀支持。受维护 "
"profile 负责精确对齐及其实际厂商向量符号；手写输入或产物元数据不能赋予其他启动代码该能力。"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:123
msgid ""
"For example, this complete layout file selects the final 384 KiB of Sky "
"STM32F407VET6 Flash. Select it with the assembly's `layout` path. The "
"decimal origin is `0x08020000`; the omitted first 128 KiB is not another "
"selected image and is not protected from writes by this layout."
msgstr ""
"例如，这个完整 layout 文件选择天空星 STM32F407VET6 Flash 的最后 384 KiB。通过装配的 `layout` "
"路径选择它。十进制 origin 对应 `0x08020000`；省略的前 128 KiB 不是另一个所选镜像，也不会因本 layout 而获得写保护。"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:142
msgid ""
"For an offset image or nonzero reservations, generated linker checks require"
" `.isr_vector` at the derived executable origin, correct alignment, a "
"nonempty table no larger than 512 bytes, and the actual vendor symbol at the"
" section base: `g_pfnVectors` for F407 or `__gVectors` for GD470. The "
"reviewed startup sets VTOR from that linked symbol with the required "
"barriers. Default zero-reservation reset-address linking keeps its existing "
"semantics."
msgstr ""
"对于偏移镜像或非零保留量，生成的链接检查要求 `.isr_vector` 位于派生的执行起点、满足对齐、向量表非空且不超过 512 "
"字节，并要求真实厂商符号位于该 section 起点：F407 为 `g_pfnVectors`，GD470 为 "
"`__gVectors`。已复核的启动代码由该链接符号设置 VTOR，并执行所需屏障。默认零保留量、复位地址链接保持原有语义。"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:149
msgid ""
"ELF LOAD bounds, Flash capacity and footprint use the derived executable "
"window. The resource checker independently validates the physical owner, "
"reservations, vector words, reset entry and all actual Flash LOAD ranges "
"against that window. ELF-to-BIN checks reconstruct bytes from the executable"
" origin. They add no prefix or suffix bytes. Physical erase/program facts "
"and RAM budgets remain unchanged; use `flash`, not `layout.origin`, to "
"interpret erase geometry."
msgstr ""
"ELF LOAD 边界、Flash 容量与占用跨度均采用派生的执行窗口。资源检查器会独立核对物理擦除区、保留量、向量字、复位入口，以及所有真实 "
"Flash LOAD 范围是否符合该窗口。ELF-to-BIN 检查从执行起点重建字节，不添加前缀或尾部内容。物理擦除/编程事实和 RAM "
"预算保持不变；解释擦除几何应使用 `flash`，不能以 `layout.origin` 重新编号。"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:156
msgid ""
"The complete [public image-window reference](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/cmake/package/verification/image_window/README.md) selects a 128 KiB "
"F407 sector owner at `[0x08020000, 0x08040000)`. Its 512-byte prefix and "
"1,024-byte suffix derive `[0x08020200, 0x0803fc00)`, or 129,536 bytes, for "
"vectors and executable LOADs. The reference links the actual reviewed "
"startup through the installed SDK; its declared 2,048-byte MSP is not a "
"measured stack peak."
msgstr ""
"完整的[公开执行窗口参考](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/cmake/package/verification/image_window/README.md)选择 F407 的一个 128 KiB"
" 扇区 `[0x08020000, 0x08040000)`。512 字节前缀和 1,024 字节尾部派生出 `[0x08020200, "
"0x0803fc00)` 执行区，共 129,536 字节，用于向量表与执行 LOAD。该参考通过安装 SDK 链接真实已复核的启动代码；声明的 "
"2,048 字节 MSP 并非实测堆栈峰值。"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:163
msgid ""
"Complete F407 assembly with explicit byte reservations; layout.json is part "
"of the linked public reference."
msgstr "带显式字节保留量的完整 F407 装配；layout.json 位于链接的公开参考中。"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:168
msgid ""
"A prefix reservation does not create an image header. A suffix reservation "
"does not create a trailer, activation marker or rollback record. Products "
"supply any metadata format, keys, Flash permissions and recovery policy. The"
" platform does not build a bootloader or authenticate, install, activate or "
"boot this image."
msgstr ""
"前缀保留量不会生成镜像头。尾部保留量不会生成 trailer、激活标记或回滚记录。元数据格式、密钥、Flash "
"权限与恢复策略均由产品提供。平台不会构建引导器，也不负责认证、安装、激活或引导此镜像。"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:173
msgid ""
"An offset executable still needs a product-owned boot path that reaches its "
"vendor reset entry with valid initial machine state. Linking, vector checks "
"and BIN identity do not execute that path. This mechanism does not provide "
"image authentication, activation, A/B rollback, Flash permissions or a "
"general running image handoff. Baremetal or FreeRTOS links prove their build"
" scope only. In particular, the existing F407 handoff retains PRIMASK=1 and "
"startup does not unmask it; no FreeRTOS handoff qualification follows from "
"an offset link."
msgstr ""
"偏移可执行文件仍需要产品拥有的启动路径，在有效初始机器状态下进入其 vendor reset entry。链接、向量检查和 BIN "
"身份不会执行这条路径。该机制不提供镜像认证、激活、A/B 回滚、Flash 权限或通用运行态镜像交接。裸机或 FreeRTOS "
"链接只证明各自构建范围。尤其是现有 F407 handoff 保留 PRIMASK=1，startup 不主动解除屏蔽；偏移链接不能建立 "
"FreeRTOS handoff 资格。"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:181
msgid "Inspect and generate"
msgstr "检查并生成"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:183
msgid "Run from the repository root, using a new output you own:"
msgstr "从仓库根目录执行，使用自己拥有的新输出："

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:192
msgid ""
"`check` and `explain` do not generate output. `generate` publishes one "
"atomic owned bundle; failure invalidates its owned output without replacing "
"unrelated data. Inspect `resolved.json`, input identities, generated "
"`nexus_config.h`, bindings, factory, linker memory and budgets. Changing "
"declared inputs requires a fresh resolution; separate Board/backend "
"combinations use separate build roots."
msgstr ""
"`check` 与 `explain` 不生成输出。`generate` 发布一个原子自有 bundle；失败使其自有输出失效，不替换无关数据。检查 "
"`resolved.json`、输入身份、生成的 "
"`nexus_config.h`、绑定、factory、链接器内存和预算。声明输入变化要求重新解析；不同 Board/backend "
"组合使用独立构建根目录。"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:198
msgid ""
"CPU-only Runtime has a separate authored runtime TOML using the shared CPU "
"resolver. It emits Core/Arch/optional OS policy, no "
"SoC/Board/startup/factory. Do not use it to claim a full device platform. "
"The [build contract](../../design/build-system.md), [integration "
"contract](../../design/integration-contracts.md) and production field "
"model/schema own detailed accepted fields; editor completion does not "
"establish hardware capability."
msgstr ""
"CPU-only Runtime 使用独立人工编写的 runtime TOML 和共享 CPU 解析器。它只生成 Core/Arch/可选 OS "
"策略，不生成 SoC/Board/startup/factory。不得据此声明完整设备平台。[构建合同](../../design/build-"
"system.md)、[接入合同](../../design/integration-contracts.md)和生产字段模型／schema "
"拥有详细合法字段；编辑器补全不建立硬件能力。"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:66
msgid "I2C endpoint address width"
msgstr "I2C 端点寻址宽度"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:68
msgid ""
"An `i2c_device` has `address_bits = 7` by default, with an address from 8 to"
" 119. Reviewed STM32F407 polling, IRQ and DMA message providers also accept "
"`address_bits = 10`, with an address from 0 to 1023. Width is an exact "
"integer; unknown widths and booleans reject. A controller may have both "
"widths, and duplicate endpoint checks include the width. Native does not "
"acquire 10-bit support from the schema. Controller metadata uses "
"`address_bits = 0` when the width belongs to each endpoint; the endpoint "
"selected contract reports 7 or 10."
msgstr ""
"`i2c_device` 的 `address_bits` 默认 7，地址范围为 8–119。经审查的 STM32F407 polling、IRQ 与 "
"DMA message provider 还接受 `address_bits = 10`，地址范围为 "
"0–1023。宽度必须为精确整数；未知宽度和布尔值会被拒绝。同一 controller 可以连接两种宽度，重复端点检查包含宽度。Native 不会因 "
"schema 字段而获得 10-bit 支持。宽度归各 endpoint 所有时，controller metadata 使用 "
"`address_bits = 0`；endpoint selected contract 返回 7 或 10。"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:76
msgid ""
"A 10-bit read includes its own repeated START before the read header. ES0182"
" Rev19 section 2.10.4 therefore restricts the maintained F407 10-bit profile"
" to `max_hz <= 88000` in Standard mode or explicit Fast mode with `max_hz > "
"100000`. The default 100 kHz profile must be changed explicitly; 42 MHz PCLK"
" is not an erratum exemption. Firmware also checks the actual CCR before "
"borrowing storage or starting hardware. The authored ceiling and ARM link "
"checks do not qualify physical rise times, target devices or bus timing."
msgstr ""
"10-bit read 在读取 header 之前包含一次内部 repeated START。因此，ES0182 Rev19 第 2.10.4 "
"节将已维护 F407 的 10-bit profile 限制为 Standard 的 `max_hz <= 88000`，或显式 Fast 的 "
"`max_hz > 100000`。必须显式修改默认 100 kHz profile；42 MHz PCLK "
"不豁免该勘误。固件也会在借用存储或启动硬件之前检查实际 CCR。人工配置的上限与 ARM 链接检查不建立实际上升时间、目标器件或总线时序资格。"
